    "description": "The Inventory Adjustment API enables users to modify stock levels for specific inventory items within a commerce platform. This functionality is essential for maintaining accurate inventory records, ensuring that stock levels reflect real-time changes due to sales, returns, or other adjustments. Typical consumers of this API are e-commerce businesses and inventory management systems that require precise control over their stock levels. By facilitating inventory adjustments, this API supports efficient operations and enhances overall supply chain management.",
